# UI standards

Professional B2B SaaS look: clear hierarchy, cards, subtle borders, status badges, consistent spacing. Prefer Server Components; mark `"use client"` only when needed.

Every list/detail page needs loading, empty, error, and success states. Reuse `DataTable`, `EmptyState`, `ErrorState`, `StatusBadge`, `MoneyDisplay`, `ConfirmDialog`.

Do not hardcode business rules in the UI. Validate with Zod + React Hook Form. Tables must paginate; do not load unbounded lists into the browser.
